1359
01:48:28,992 --> 01:48:29,992
Frío.

1360
01:48:39,492 --> 01:48:40,492
Estúpido.

1361
01:48:41,292 --> 01:48:42,292
Esquivar.

1362
01:48:43,452 --> 01:48:44,622
si te golpean

1363
01:48:45,822 --> 01:48:46,822
esquivar.

1364
01:48:48,552 --> 01:48:49,552
De nuevo.

1365
01:49:14,232 --> 01:49:15,372
futuro propietario

1366
